              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Hay 4.8-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Duuba Elishani niiti worra Shunemu, ta inni ilma isii duisa keesaa kaase taanini qaraa waan jed'e kai, siifi worri keetileeni fulla d'ibiti godaana; AABBO Waaqi haga ganna torba lafa tana beela iti buusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba isiini dubbi Elisha ch'aqafte, worra isii fud'atte, kaate godaante, ganna torba lafa Filisti keesa teete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganni torbeeso hobae jennaani lafa Israeliti deebite, gara hayyu d'at'e, mana kiyyafi lafa tiyya na deebisi jetteeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa isiini fulla hayyu d'ufte, hayyuuni Gehazi, hojattu Elisha, woliini haasau jira. Hayyichi waan mama ka Elishani tolche isa iraa odeefachu jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato Gehazini tae aka Elishani nama due kaase hayyuuti himu jiru, niitiini taani olseente, mana kiyyafi lafa tiyya na deebisi hayyuuni jette. Gehazini waan isaani jed'e, Ee hayyicha, niitiini tana, ammalle gurbaani isii ka Elishani kaaseleeni kuno kana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni, Dubbini sunini jirti? jed'e isi gaafate jennaani, Ee injirti, jetteeni. Jennaani hayyichi nama toko yaame, waan niiti tana ch'ufa deebisaafi, ammalle waan lafti isii ganna torbaani isiini ala teete suni baaftele ch'ufa deebisaafi jed'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elishafi Benhadadi hayyu Shamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa toko ka hayyuuni Shamu Benhadadini fayya intahiini, Elishani Damaski d'aqe. Hayyichi aka Elishani d'ufe d'agaye jennaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan Hazaelini jed'e, Raaga suni waan kana geesifi, waan jettuuni, Aka anini fayyu AABBO Waaqa naa gaafad'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Hazaelini gaala afurtama waan dadansa dira Damaski keesaa argatani ch'ufa iti fayye, gara Elisha d'aqe. Hazaelini isaani bahe jennaani inni waan jed'eeni. Ilmi kanke hayyu Benhadadini na erge, beeni, Elisha aka anini d'ukuba fayyu AABBO Waaqa naa gaafad'i nani jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elishani waan jed'eeni, Beeni, AABBO Waaqi yayu aka atini fayya d'aba kana fayyite, ammo eege dootu na garsiise jed'iini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Elishani aka male fuula yakate, ila iti qabe, Hazaeli laale ch'eerse bohe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazaelini waan jed'eeni, Aabbo, atini maanifi boota? Elishani waan jed'eeni, Waan hamtu atini worra Israeli tolchitu anini imbeekha, atini dira worra jajaba gubde, nama worraa kaima ch'ufa qaqalte, ijoolle worraa ch'ufa ch'ach'arasite, nad'eeni worraa ta garaacha qabdu ch'ufa garaa baqasita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
