              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 27.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bara Yehoramuni lafa fide suni, worri Edomu finna worra Yuda dide hayyu ufi fohate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yehoramuni gaari isaa ka fardi hirkisu ch'ufa guurate, Sairi d'aqe, achiti askartini Edomu worra Marsite. Halkani suni isaafi worri isaa ka gugurda askarti gaarini yaatu, nyaapa suni iti ch'abse, askartini ch'uftileeni worra ufiti baqatte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Edomu haga arrale finna worra Yuda jala injiru. Baruma suni worri Libnaleeni finna worra Yuda jalaa bahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Yehoramuni tolche ch'ufa kitaaba Odu Hayyoota Yuda keesati t'aafaniti, t'aafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoramuni due irreesa hayyoota ka dira Daudi keesati awaalani, jennaani ilmi isaa Ahaziani fulla isaa hayyu tahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Yuda ka Ahazia jed'ani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna kud'ani lameeso ka Yehoramuni, ilmi Ahabu, hayyu Israeli tahe, Ahaziani, ilmi Yehoramu, hayyu Yuda tahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi ganni isaa diddami lama, duuba inni ganna toko Yerusalemu keesa worra Yuda mohate. Haati isaa Athalia, isiini dubra Ahabu, ka hayyu Israeli ammalle akhaakhuni isii, Omri, ka innileeni duri hayyu Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Ahaziani soda Ahabu taheefi, inni worra Ahabu gula bahe AABBO Waaqa durati ch'ubbu tolche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziani Yehoramu hayyu Israeliti goli tahe, worri woliini Yae, hayyu Shamu ka Hazaeli jed'ani had'e. Ramothi ka Gileaditi woli had'ani, Yehoramu had'iisa suni keesati madeesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni aka fayyu dira Yezreeli d'aqe achi tae; ato inni achi jiru Ahaziani isa argu d'aqe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yehu muudani hayyu Israeli tolchani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
